# Agentic CODEOWNERS — routing plus a trust-root review contract
# Maps areas to the reviewers best suited for the domain.
#
# SECURITY LIMITATION: CODEOWNERS alone cannot require that approval is
# non-author, current for the exact head, or different from the last pusher.
# The main-branch ruleset must require Code Owner approval, dismiss stale
# approvals on new commits, require approval of the most recent reviewable push,
# block force-pushes, and require the Guardian trusted status check.

# Core infrastructure — ops agent
.github/                    @frankxai
package.json                @frankxai
pnpm-lock.yaml              @frankxai
*.config.*                  @frankxai
turbo.json                  @frankxai
pnpm-workspace.yaml         @frankxai

# Web app — frontend agent
apps/web/                   @frankxai
apps/web/components/        @frankxai
apps/web/app/               @frankxai

# Intelligence substrate — lore / guardian agent
.arcanea/                   @frankxai
book/                       @frankxai

# Supabase — backend agent
supabase/                   @frankxai

# Packages — specialist per package
packages/                   @frankxai

# Sacred: Claude commands, agents, instructions — protected after 073bc640 incident
.claude/                    @frankxai
.claude/commands/           @frankxai
.claude/agents/             @frankxai
CLAUDE.md                   @frankxai
**/CLAUDE.md                @frankxai
.githooks/                  @frankxai
scripts/install-hooks.sh    @frankxai
RECOVERY.md                 @frankxai

# Guardian trust root — keep these last so they override broader patterns.
# Changes cannot self-certify. Require an exact-head approval from a non-author
# repository admin before applying the guardian-trusted-run label. After
# bootstrap changes reach main, that admin must run POST_MERGE_CANARY.
# When @frankxai authored the change, this current single-owner mapping cannot
# satisfy that contract: add a verified second admin/code owner before merge.
/.github/workflows/guardian-pr-check.yml @frankxai
/scripts/guardian-council.mjs            @frankxai
/scripts/guardian-council.test.mjs       @frankxai
